  {
    "repo": "stm32h7xx-hal-driver",
    "pr_number": 91,
    "title": "Fix HAL_FDCAN_GetRxMessage GetIndex computation overflow in overwrite mode",
    "state": "closed",
    "merged": false,
    "draft": false,
    "author": "lukas-lang",
    "labels": [
      "bug",
      "internal bug tracker",
      "hal",
      "fdcan"
    ],
    "created_at": "2025-08-18T08:23:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-26T09:45:46Z",
    "closed_at": "2025-09-26T09:45:45Z",
    "merged_at": null,
    "body": "This fixes a buffer overflow that was likely caused by an incomplete fix of #3\r\n\r\nWhen the CAN peripheral RX FIFO is configured in overwrite mode, the `GetIndex` is (correctly) incremented by 1 to avoid reading from the element the peripheral might be writing to:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/STMicroelectronics/stm32h7xx-hal-driver/blob/dbfb749f229e1aa89e50b54229ca87766e180d2d/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fdcan.c#L3015-L3028\r\n\r\nHowever, this ignores the fact that `GetIndex` might be pointing at the last element, in which case it has to be wrapped around instead. This PR fixes this by moving the offset-by-1 after the main `GetIndex` computation, and sets `GetIndex` to 0 if it overflowed. This should be the most performant way to do it, as the check is only done when the FIFO is actually full and overwrite mode is enabled.\r\n\r\n",
    "github_url": "https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/stm32h7xx-hal-driver/pull/91",
    "head_ref": "FDCAN_FIFO_Overflow_Fix",
    "base_ref": "master",
    "merge_commit_sha": null,
    "commits_count": 1,
    "review_comments_count": 0,
    "comments_count": 2,
    "changed_files_count": 1,
    "additions": 21,
    "deletions": 8,
    "linked_issue_numbers": [
      3
    ],
    "files_changed": [
      {
        "filename": "Src/stm32h7xx_hal_fdcan.c",
        "status": "modified",
        "additions": 21,
        "deletions": 8,
        "changes": 29,
        "previous_filename": null,
        "blob_url": "https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/stm32h7xx-hal-driver/blob/be9c8f73842d0cc398cca735ab2a8d48dc09f52c/Src%2Fstm32h7xx_hal_fdcan.c",
        "raw_url": "https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/stm32h7xx-hal-driver/raw/be9c8f73842d0cc398cca735ab2a8d48dc09f52c/Src%2Fstm32h7xx_hal_fdcan.c"
      }
    ]
  },
